1
00:00:00,603 --> 00:00:03,353
(Sheldon:)And she touched my food.

2
00:00:03,731 --> 00:00:07,531
(Sheldon:)Okay, yes, I took her clothes,
but she started it.

3
00:00:07,693 --> 00:00:10,193
(Sheldon:)No, that's not fair.

4
00:00:11,697 --> 00:00:14,117
(Sheldon:)Why should I have to apologize?

5
00:00:14,283 --> 00:00:18,083
(Sheldon:)I really don't think this is the kind of thing
Jesus concerns himself with.

6
00:00:19,413 --> 00:00:22,963
(Sheldon:)No, you're right. I don't really know
what Jesus thinks about.

7
00:00:23,126 --> 00:00:24,166
All right!

8
00:00:24,335 --> 00:00:26,165
(Sheldon:)Goodbye.

9
00:00:29,173 --> 00:00:31,883
(Sheldon:)- Did you tell on me?
- Are you kidding me?

10
00:00:32,051 --> 00:00:33,381
(Leonard:)I already have two strikes.

11
00:00:39,976 --> 00:00:41,556
(Sheldon:)Penny.

12
00:00:41,727 --> 00:00:43,307
(Sheldon:)Penny.

13
00:00:43,479 --> 00:00:45,059
(Sheldon:)Penny.

14
00:00:46,858 --> 00:00:49,858
(Sheldon:)I am very, very sorry
for what I have done.

15
00:00:50,027 --> 00:00:51,487
(Sheldon:)Here's your laundry.

16
00:00:51,654 --> 00:00:55,444
(Sheldon:)I rescind your strikes
and you are no longer banished.

17
00:00:56,492 --> 00:00:59,022
(Penny:)Can I sit wherever I want?

